    "alert_id": "ALERT_004",
    "title": "No clinician plan documented",
    "message": "Guidelines require use of a screening tool to identify developing signs and symptoms in patients on ART, and TDF-specific annual creatinine and eGFR monitoring. No assessment or plan was documented for this visit despite abnormal eGFR (52), proteinuria, rising creatinine trend, and patient-reported fatigue. Required actions include renal evaluation, TDF discontinuation per contraindication criteria, and symptom screening. The absence of a plan represents a guideline deviation given the clear abnormalities present.",
    "issue_type": "plan_review",
    "severity": "high",
    "recommended_action": "Document assessment addressing eGFR 52, proteinuria, and fatigue. Plan TDF discontinuation, renal workup, and ART regimen modification.",
